     5293       bfs_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-doc-cur    =  - bf_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-doc-cur
     5294       bfs_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-doc-cur    =  - bf_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-doc-cur
